    "intro_eng": {
      "type": "fye-rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "band": "ivory",
        "narrow": true,
        "heading": "What are you choosing between?",
        "body": "<p>Every engagement ring on this page is made to order in our London workshop in platinum or gold, in styles from solitaire and halo to trilogy and toi et moi, with ten diamond shapes or a coloured gemstone at the centre. Centre stones are natural or lab-grown, each with a GIA or IGI certificate, and every price is fixed before we make. Rings take 3 to 4 weeks; bespoke designs 2 to 5 weeks.</p><p>Read the <a href=\"/pages/engagement-ring-guide\">Engagement Ring Guide</a>, <a href=\"/pages/diamond-4cs\">the 4Cs explained</a> and our <a href=\"/pages/engagement-ring-budget\">note on budget</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/contact-us#popup-contact\">book a free consultation</a>.</p>",
        "variant": "default",
        "eyebrow": "Start here"
      }
    },
