        "narrow": true,
        "heading": "What makes our engagement rings ethical?",
        "body": "<ol><li>Natural diamonds sourced under the Kimberley Process and the World Diamond Council System of Warranties.</li><li>Lab-grown diamonds offered in every setting, with the same GIA or IGI certification.</li><li>Responsibly sourced precious metals, hallmarked at a UK Assay Office.</li></ol><p>Read more about <a href=\"/pages/ethical-sourcing\">how we source our stones and metals</a>.</p>",
